  "summary": "The SmythOS/sre repository is a monorepo containing the SRE core runtime, SDK, and CLI packages for building and running production AI agents, with a unified provider-abstraction layer, a Candidate/ACL security model, and 40+ built-in components. Contributor-facing docs describe pnpm-based build/test workflows, DCO sign-off, and private security reporting; NOTICE.md states some SmythOS modules are proprietary and kept in private repositories. Evidence coverage: 182 of 236 packet slices were shown to the model; the rest were withheld by the prompt budget.",
